 "Daliani_CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateHero.png", "id": "975740844843565", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_975740848176898_614160356923714657_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z6YKWUJglNIQ7kNvwGFbgZz&_nc_oc=AdovCnRLbC4tlMnaDxY0Qig4Doxso3hrOl7-qWa2ryiR7QUvc8XahOCJ6pX4S8HVaHI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7WA3mRA0Qz2-U81qzSQKnCw-r_LFlQtBU1dGrfX5Sweg&oe=6A1D978A"}, {"file_name": "Daliani Icon v5.png", "id": "973386741839825", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_973386745173158_2197407544904841183_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HWr6lDkvyOsQ7kNvwEJeLzK&_nc_oc=AdpwJx-jJj_w-CUAtBu8EwtS5vAUgfJiAFlZLAYqcuVzK9PiWOUQoSQuCARkN5Al2-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7oaoLLD8c0L4ZreRxy0RYsnRAwp07_tqSw2obau6xQAw&oe=6A1D849F"}]}, "id": "1525119779239018", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "com.Dotsoft.Daliani-20260505-151821 copy.png", "id": "971781582104951", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823930_971781585438284_8408649887222969230_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=85LGg0lFiNcQ7kNvwHCeSij&_nc_oc=AdremzrU4tZ2Gf45C_tbV2OPR2U6Uxzjyrk0SsNcKnC7WD6o6C1gYvr8L9wVRTevZY4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6W779iq5VtXY-2c7pTWZELIe4xAahBV8Y6ORhaeaqTmA&oe=6A1D8818"}, {"file_name": "com.Dotsoft.Daliani-20260505-152006.png", "id": "1007960685001694", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624700_1007960688335027_8508758570384968444_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AWMgT57TufwQ7kNvwHTARRS&_nc_oc=AdpWPPsUkpBD0MJwbFYuh4vhKF4d9MV5yeBL2zHz01q5oJoaE9ULYEL16EsRnS80bsE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af648xaWfKTTjg4bNGPu6mjlbl0jbtqMq_urk5vuC7sVrw&oe=6A1D98E6"}, {"file_name": "com.Dotsoft.Daliani-20260505-152154.png", "id": "1259224769624969", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830467_1259224772958302_5944639226009981632_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1ucHDfF8mvAQ7kNvwFPM4b6&_nc_oc=Adri_RMbmr44iq_BtZbNlehlajP9Br-UAW76-rkhVCYjKtRfOPh8hxI7NDXi81Lvf-Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7wjNaPngcW54_7nxuyAAbBBeORd1UjxQbjeHaHmISVNA&oe=6A1D7FF5"}, {"file_name": "com.Dotsoft.Daliani-20260505-152135.png", "id": "943990228508203", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819859_943990231841536_5409489005583405348_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hcJrZ8IMFOAQ7kNvwEFB_7-&_nc_oc=Adr5Tc20qnjYo9ZfHP9RH-zGAkRsCV4TafkwUIcnwQWjtrSF0-fJFZRKeEKQQu1bRPw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7cTMng86heVWhfg4dagP8Fa16ykH-vRDwx7w40wcxGIQ&oe=6A1D95C0"}, {"file_name": "com.Dotsoft.Daliani-20260505-152145.png", "id": "1459990641994438", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823905_1459990645327771_3687014525619409846_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Nlnu2eSMPqIQ7kNvwHIT1dF&_nc_oc=AdriH0eQ_dR9Ou2t83cXS_6LO1sKnTHS1EFDaNYApYf0VwVki6GpfZmuvdLuuEx6cyE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4ZSfYqwn5y1MhcVqDxZVfHdDpL8KbdMhEEFEgfNn_3_g&oe=6A1D8EB0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Daliani: Living Tradition", "keywords": ["heritage", "fishing", "game", "narrative", "story"], "long_description": "In Daliani: Living Tradition, you become Apostolis, a 17-year-old visiting his uncle Petros at a traditional fishing installation in Preveza for the first time.\n\nFrom the viewpoint on the tower, you listen to local fishermen, answer dialogue prompts, and learn how the net, winches, timing, and observation shape the Daliani fishing method. Use the mechanisms to prepare the trap, watch fish move through the water, and choose the right moment to close the net, to ensure the most successful catch.\n\nBlending guided storytelling, challenge, and cultural heritage, this VR experience introduces players to a rare fishing tradition of the Ambracian Gulf.", "short_description": "Step onto a tower in the Ambracian Gulf and learn the traditional Ntaliani fishing technique through an interactive VR story."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Daliani Icon v5.png", "id": "2209404989875952", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823783_2209404993209285_757507465839310618_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yaNbpkIYPhAQ7kNvwHxkCPz&_nc_oc=AdpnrPTtx8UcNXRSMGuoHx13W_wHpVEw3RhJ4u28RwioobVxdQpGKr6OkinVtskfMdQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5F23GbKFMkEekj4ZrBD2VEarEDJSyfmsFew27ZC8mI5w&oe=6A1D9204"}, {"file_name": "Daliani_CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateHero_gr.png", "id": "2189045815203185", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823270_2189045818536518_1197449426069608052_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z_FrbbqMmrkQ7kNvwEyuDk3&_nc_oc=AdqZMZnoYXhz1LhuGmd397Y_ClwiMkPSrsxW0AiJp3lKUcFFU_9hiGGapx1CDVjDWF4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7qx34oImQmFuLqpxwoNd4DxbGCwjGvxjcCCUqWz_4E9g&oe=6A1D9D73"}, {"file_name": "Daliani_CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_gr.png", "id": "1772726590372627", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_1772726593705960_4264978315132988550_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RqdiURgAS-cQ7kNvwHYN_7L&_nc_oc=Adr-S-G7fPixTYL2dR6Wqp69s03KMOL_YHB43plsBok4cxdQMYv2615iYu3r69CYgGE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af40uc6A_60hGaI4KF2MunKhEZntCyVlUVoFVpI5e6lRgA&oe=6A1DA67F"}, {"file_name": "Daliani_CoverImageSafeAreaTemplatePortrait_gr.png", "id": "1583897133145655", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818849_1583897136478988_5796830830848411987_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=D84xpUI7NvUQ7kNvwF0R7ET&_nc_oc=AdovlC0pMBWuMlVZI5tkJJIZroHXdkULWOjxJvRFOpBgXSbwJt4YNOl2Xd2-5WH9YUE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6K36az3NU--0P2S3t5Lie5c_shzg0ZyQ-i7kSceLK6mA&oe=6A1D94E0"}, {"file_name": "Daliani_CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateSquare_gr.png", "id": "1546951613721263", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820141_1546951617054596_8071610752796397453_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bxibJzcn844Q7kNvwHDh_b2&_nc_oc=Adpq9RZbtcOf-rSjdajLACd2lsefaogg5l6Nq7xwqgnxvylbnKRPhQC1ZWzghoRXoM8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4SqedazuyUT4bAB8meVx84RkbGKZ7bijsxJQ2TT3DMJA&oe=6A1D88AD"}]}, "id": "983462414367070", "locale": "el_GR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "\u039d\u03c4\u03b1\u03bb\u03b9\u03ac\u03bd\u03b9: \u0396\u03c9\u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03bd\u03ae \u03a0\u03b1\u03c1\u03ac\u03b4\u03bf\u03c3\u03b7", "keywords": ["\u03a0\u03b1\u03c1\u03ac\u03b4\u03bf\u03c3\u03b7", "\u03a8\u03ac\u03c1\u03b5\u03bc\u03b1", "\u03a0\u03b1\u03b9\u03c7\u03bd\u03af\u03b4\u03b9", "\u0391\u03c6\u03ae\u03b3\u03b7\u03c3\u03b7", "\u0399\u03c3\u03c4\u03bf\u03c1\u03af\u03b1"], "long_description": "\u03a3\u03c4\u03bf \u039d\u03c4\u03b1\u03bb\u03b9\u03ac\u03bd\u03b9: \u0396\u03c9\u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03bd\u03ae \u03a0\u03b1\u03c1\u03ac\u03b4\u03bf\u03c3\u03b7, \u03b1\u03bd\u03b1\u03bb\u03b1\u03bc\u03b2\u03ac\u03bd\u03b5\u03b9\u03c2 \u03c4\u03bf\u03bd \u03c1\u03cc\u03bb\u03bf \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u0391\u03c0\u03bf\u03c3\u03c4\u03cc\u03bb\u03b7, \u03b5\u03bd\u03cc\u03c2 17\u03c7\u03c1\u03bf\u03bd\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c0\u03bf\u03c5 \u03b5\u03c0\u03b9\u03c3\u03ba\u03ad\u03c0\u03c4\u03b5\u03c4\u03b1\u03b9 \u03b3\u03b9\u03b1 \u03c0\u03c1\u03ce\u03c4\u03b7 \u03c6\u03bf\u03c1\u03ac \u03c4\u03bf \u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03bb\u03b9\u03ac\u03bd\u03b9 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u03b8\u03b5\u03af\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u03a0\u03ad\u03c4\u03c1\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c3\u03c4\u03b7\u03bd \u03a0\u03c1\u03ad\u03b2\u03b5\u03b6\u03b1.\n\n\u0391\u03c0\u03cc \u03c4\u03bf\u03bd \u03c0\u03cd\u03c1\u03b3\u03bf, \u03b1\u03ba\u03bf\u03cd\u03c2 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5\u03c2 \u03c8\u03b1\u03c1\u03ac\u03b4\u03b5\u03c2, \u03b5\u03bc\u03c0\u03bb\u03ad\u03ba\u03b5\u03c3\u03b1\u03b9 \u03c3\u03b5 \u03b4\u03b9\u03b1\u03bb\u03cc\u03b3\u03bf\u03c5\u03c2 \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03bc\u03b1\u03b8\u03b1\u03af\u03bd\u03b5\u03b9\u03c2 \u03c0\u03ce\u03c2 \u03c4\u03bf \u03b4\u03af\u03c7\u03c4\u03c5, \u03b7 \u03c0\u03b1\u03c1\u03b1\u03c4\u03ae\u03c1\u03b7\u03c3\u03b7 \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03c4\u03bf \u03c3\u03c9\u03c3\u03c4\u03cc timing \u03c3\u03c5\u03bd\u03b8\u03ad\u03c4\u03bf\u03c5\u03bd \u03c4\u03b7\u03bd \u03c4\u03b5\u03c7\u03bd\u03b9\u03ba\u03ae \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03bb\u03b9\u03ac\u03bd\u03b9. \u03a7\u03b5\u03b9\u03c1\u03af\u03c3\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5\u03c2 \u03bc\u03b7\u03c7\u03b1\u03bd\u03b9\u03c3\u03bc\u03bf\u03cd\u03c2, \u03c0\u03b1\u03c1\u03b1\u03ba\u03bf\u03bb\u03bf\u03cd\u03b8\u03b7\u03c3\u03b5 \u03c4\u03b1 \u03ba\u03bf\u03c0\u03ac\u03b4\u03b9\u03b1 \u03c8\u03b1\u03c1\u03b9\u03ce\u03bd \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03b4\u03b9\u03ac\u03bb\u03b5\u03be\u03b5 \u03c4\u03b7 \u03c3\u03c9\u03c3\u03c4\u03ae \u03c3\u03c4\u03b9\u03b3\u03bc\u03ae \u03b3\u03b9\u03b1 \u03bd\u03b1 \u03ba\u03bb\u03b5\u03af\u03c3\u03b5\u03b9\u03c2 \u03c4\u03b7\u03bd \u03c0\u03b1\u03b3\u03af\u03b4\u03b1, \u03ce\u03c3\u03c4\u03b5 \u03bd\u03b1 \u03b5\u03c0\u03b9\u03c4\u03cd\u03c7\u03b5\u03b9\u03c2 \u03c4\u03b7 \u03bc\u03ad\u03b3\u03b7\u03c3\u03c4\u03b7 \u03c8\u03b1\u03c1\u03b9\u03ac!\n\n\u039c\u03b9\u03b1 \u03c3\u03cd\u03bd\u03c4\u03bf\u03bc\u03b7 VR \u03b5\u03bc\u03c0\u03b5\u03b9\u03c1\u03af\u03b1 \u03c0\u03bf\u03c5 \u03c3\u03c5\u03bd\u03b4\u03c5\u03ac\u03b6\u03b5\u03b9 \u03b1\u03c6\u03ae\u03b3\u03b7\u03c3\u03b7, \u03c0\u03c1\u03cc\u03ba\u03bb\u03b7\u03c3\u03b7 \u03ba\u03b1\u03b9 \u03c0\u03bf\u03bb\u03b9\u03c4\u03b9\u03c3\u03c4\u03b9\u03ba\u03ae \u03ba\u03bb\u03b7\u03c1\u03bf\u03bd\u03bf\u03bc\u03b9\u03ac, \u03b6\u03c9\u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03bd\u03b5\u03cd\u03bf\u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03c2 \u03c4\u03b7 \u03c3\u03c0\u03ac\u03bd\u03b9\u03b1 \u03b1\u03bb\u03b9\u03b5\u03c5\u03c4\u03b9\u03ba\u03ae \u03c0\u03b1\u03c1\u03ac\u03b4\u03bf\u03c3\u03b7 \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u0391\u03bc\u03b2\u03c1\u03b1\u03ba\u03b9\u03ba\u03bf\u03cd \u039a\u03cc\u03bb\u03c0\u03bf\u03c5.", "short_description": "\u0391\u03c0\u03cc \u03c4\u03bf\u03bd \u03c0\u03cd\u03c1\u03b3\u03bf \u03c4\u03bf\u03c5 \u039d\u03c4\u03b1\u03bb\u03b9\u03ac\u03bd\u03b9 \u03c3\u03c4\u03bf\u03bd \u0391\u03bc\u03b2\u03c1\u03b1\u03ba\u03b9\u03ba\u03cc \u03b3\u03bd\u03ce\u03c1\u03b9\u03c3\u03b5 \u03c4\u03b7\u03bd \u03c0\u03b1\u03c1\u03b1\u03b4\u03bf\u03c3\u03b9\u03b1\u03ba\u03ae \u03c4\u03b5\u03c7\u03bd\u03b9\u03ba\u03ae \u03bd\u03c4\u03b1\u03bb\u03b9\u03ac\u03bd\u03b9 \u03bc\u03ad\u03c3\u03b1 \u03b1\u03c0\u03cc \u03bc\u03b9\u03b1 \u03b4\u03b9\u03b1\u03b4\u03c1\u03b1\u03c3\u03c4\u03b9\u03ba\u03ae VR \u03b9\u03c3\u03c4\u03bf\u03c1\u03af\u03b1."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dotsoft.gr/en/privacy-policy-app-daliani-living-tradition", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "DOTSOFT SA", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://dotsoft.gr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1008279844328894"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in